      {
        "id": "E2",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "You choose which apps Muse can use, can see everything it does, review its output and decide what it remembers.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://about.fb.com/news/2026/11/muse-now-available-in-the-uk-muse-does-the-work-you-stay-in-control/",
        "source": "Meta Newsroom",
