      },
      {
        "id": "E3",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Muse, Meta’s personal AI agent, is now available to adults in the UK.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://about.fb.com/news/2026/11/muse-now-available-in-the-uk-muse-does-the-work-you-stay-in-control/",
        "source": "Meta Newsroom",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-24T06:00:04.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-26T19:33:56.353Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E4",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "To get those jobs done you can connect Muse to the apps you already use, from your email and calendar to the retailer apps you shop on.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://about.fb.com/news/2026/11/muse-now-available-in-the-uk-muse-does-the-work-you-stay-in-control/",
        "source": "Meta Newsroom",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-24T06:00:04.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-26T19:33:56.353Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E5",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "That’s why we’ve designed Muse so you stay in control at every step.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://about.fb.com/news/2026/11/muse-now-available-in-the-uk-muse-does-the-work-you-stay-in-control/",
        "source": "Meta Newsroom",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-24T06:00:04.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-26T19:33:56.353Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E6",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Once you’ve decided what Muse is connected to and what you want it to do, with your oversight, it can handle tasks like searching, comparing and planning for you.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://about.fb.com/news/2026/11/muse-now-available-in-the-uk-muse-does-the-work-you-stay-in-control/",
        "source": "Meta Newsroom",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-24T06:00:04.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-26T19:33:56.353Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E7",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Muse only works with the apps and services you choose to connect it to, and you control the access it gets.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://about.fb.com/news/2026/11/muse-now-available-in-the-uk-muse-does-the-work-you-stay-in-control/",
        "source": "Meta Newsroom",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-24T06:00:04.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-26T19:33:56.353Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E8",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "When you connect an app, Muse uses information from it to help with the tasks you give it: connecting your email lets Muse proactively review your email to let you know of anything important, not download your whole inbox – unless that’s what you ask it to do.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://about.fb.com/news/2026/11/muse-now-available-in-the-uk-muse-does-the-work-you-stay-in-control/",
        "source": "Meta Newsroom",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-24T06:00:04.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-26T19:33:56.353Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E9",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Each yes covers only what you approved, and you can change or remove access, or disconnect a service, whenever you want.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://about.fb.com/news/2026/11/muse-now-available-in-the-uk-muse-does-the-work-you-stay-in-control/",
        "source": "Meta Newsroom",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-24T06:00:04.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-26T19:33:56.353Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E10",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Muse can use what you can already see on these apps to help you – like turning a recipe Reel you’ve saved into a shopping list.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://about.fb.com/news/2026/11/muse-now-available-in-the-uk-muse-does-the-work-you-stay-in-control/",
        "source": "Meta Newsroom",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-24T06:00:04.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-26T19:33:56.353Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E11",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Muse remembers what matters to you, so you don’t have to repeat yourself.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://about.fb.com/news/2026/11/muse-now-available-in-the-uk-muse-does-the-work-you-stay-in-control/",
        "source": "Meta Newsroom",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-24T06:00:04.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-26T19:33:56.353Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E12",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Ultimately, you stay in control — you tell your Muse what actions to take, what permissions it has and review its output.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://about.fb.com/news/2026/11/muse-now-available-in-the-uk-muse-does-the-work-you-stay-in-control/",
